  "description": "GNOME MAUI .NET is a modern, Linux-first .NET MAUI backend for building native GNOME desktop apps with C# and MAUI XAML. Built on GirCore with GTK4 and Adwaita integration, it enables the single-project model via the maui-gnome workload and the net10.0-gnome TFM. Optimized for NativeAOT with fast startup and SkiaSharp CPU/GPU rendering.",
